{"seq":1,"slug":"doc-set-add-remove-diff","title":"结果新增/消失逐条比对","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-query-replay-diff/result-set-diff/doc-set-add-remove-diff","wordCount":2228,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"结果新增-消失逐条比对\">结果新增/消失逐条比对</h1><p>两份结果集摆在面前，第一个问题永远是「哪些文档变了」。这听起来像是一次集合运算，但搜索场景下的「新增」和「消失」都带着强烈的语义色彩：一个文档从第 3 位掉到第 12 位是「排序位移」而不是「消失」，一个文档从结果里彻底不见是「消失」，而一个文档本来就没有、现在进来了是「新增」。这三类差异在工程上要用不同的逻辑处理，混淆它们会让报告失去可读性——没人能从一个只告诉你「结果集差集大小是 47」的报告里判断该不该放行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把-差异-拆成可比对的成分\">核心概念：把「差异」拆成可比对的成分</h2><p>把一个搜索响应的结果部分拆开，会得到几个可以独立比对的层次。逐条比对的目标是把每一层的差异定位到具体文档而不是只给一个总量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[基准结果 R_b] --&gt; C[按 doc_id 索引]&#10;  B[候选结果 R_c] --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; D{doc_id 在两边?}&#10;  D --&gt;|仅在 R_c| E[ADDED]&#10;  D --&gt;|仅在 R_b| F[REMOVED]&#10;  D --&gt;|两边都有| G{rank 相同?}&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H[SHIFTED]&#10;  G --&gt;|是| I{score 相同?}&#10;  I --&gt;|否| J[RESCORED]&#10;  I --&gt;|是| K[SAME]\">graph TD\n  A[基准结果 R_b] --&gt; C[按 doc_id 索引]\n  B[候选结果 R_c] --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; D{doc_id 在两边?}\n  D --&gt;|仅在 R_c| E[ADDED]\n  D --&gt;|仅在 R_b| F[REMOVED]\n  D --&gt;|两边都有| G{rank 相同?}\n  G --&gt;|否| H[SHIFTED]\n  G --&gt;|是| I{score 相同?}\n  I --&gt;|否| J[RESCORED]\n  I --&gt;|是| K[SAME]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异类型</th>\n<th>判定条件</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>典型关注度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SAME</td>\n<td>doc_id 与 rank 均相同</td>\n<td>无变化</td>\n<td>不计入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RESCORED</td>\n<td>doc_id、rank 同，score 不同</td>\n<td>打分函数改动</td>\n<td>低（多为预期）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SHIFTED</td>\n<td>两边都有但 rank 不同</td>\n<td>排序权重改动</td>\n<td>中（需看幅度）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ADDED</td>\n<td>仅在候选出现</td>\n<td>召回扩大 / 过滤放宽</td>\n<td>高（可能是垃圾结果）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>REMOVED</td>\n<td>仅在基准出现</td>\n<td>召回收缩 / 过滤收紧</td>\n<td>高（可能是漏召回）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把 RESCORED 单列出来很关键。很多团队把所有 score 变化都当成差异，结果每一次改动排序权重都会产生海量 diff，报告瞬间淹没。实际上如果 rank 没变，score 的变化对用户完全不可见，应当归入「预期内」而不是「回归候选」。这个分类直接决定后续 <a href=\"ranking-displacement-metric\">排序位移与变化度量</a> 要处理什么。</p>\n<h3 id=\"doc_id-的稳定性问题\">doc_id 的稳定性问题</h3><p>逐条比对的前提是 doc_id 在两边含义相同。这在多数场景成立，但在几种情况下会崩掉：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>索引重建后 id 变化</strong>：如果 doc_id 是自增序号或包含索引版本，重建后同一商品会拿到不同 id，导致全员 ADDED + REMOVED。解决办法是比对前做 id 归一化——用业务主键（SKU、商品 ID）而不是引擎内部 doc id 作为比对键。</li>\n<li><strong>多值文档</strong>：如果一条 doc 代表一个 SPU 而结果里展示的是 SKU，那么「同一个 doc」在两边可能是不同的 SKU。比对必须在展示粒度上进行，不能在下游粒度和上游 doc 粒度之间混淆。</li>\n<li><strong>聚合/折叠</strong>：结果经过折叠（collapse）后，同一折叠键下只会保留一条代表性 doc。如果两边的代表选择不同，看起来是 REMOVED + ADDED，实际是同一组文档换了代表——参见 <a href=\"pagination-aggregate-consistency\">分页/聚合/折叠一致性 Diff</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此逐条比对的第一步永远是<strong>定义比对键</strong>，并在配置里显式声明，而不是默认用引擎返回的 <code>_id</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# diff 比对键与归一化配置&#10;diff:&#10;  key:&#10;    field: &#39;sku_id&#39; # 业务主键，索引重建后保持稳定&#10;    normalize: [&#39;strip_case&#39;] # 大小写归一&#10;  compare_scope:&#10;    max_rank: 100 # 只比前 100 位（用户可见范围）&#10;    require_full_recall: false # 不全量比对，允许深度位置差异忽略&#10;  classify:&#10;    rescore_is_diff: false # rank 未变的 score 变化不计入 diff&#10;    min_shift_rank: 1 # 位移至少 1 位才算 SHIFTED\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># diff 比对键与归一化配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">diff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    field</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sku_id'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 业务主键，索引重建后保持稳定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    normalize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'strip_case'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 大小写归一</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  compare_scope</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    max_rank</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 只比前 100 位（用户可见范围）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    require_full_recall</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 不全量比对，允许深度位置差异忽略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  classify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rescore_is_diff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # rank 未变的 score 变化不计入 diff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    min_shift_rank</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 位移至少 1 位才算 SHIFTED</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>max_rank</code> 是另一个必须显式决定的边界。前 10 位是用户真正消费的位置，第 90 位和第 95 位之间的位移对业务没有意义。把比对范围限定在用户可见区间，能砍掉大量无意义 diff。</p>\n<h2 id=\"新增与消失的归因链\">新增与消失的归因链</h2><p>知道「哪些文档新增/消失了」只是第一步，报告的价值来自<strong>为什么</strong>。归因需要沿着检索链路的阶段往回追——一个好的回放平台会在采集时就把中间阶段的候选集落盘，让归因成为一次可查询的关联而不是靠猜。</p>\n<h3 id=\"从候选链路定位消失原因\">从候选链路定位消失原因</h3><p>一个文档从结果里消失，可能发生在链路的任何一环：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>消失位置</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>召回阶段</td>\n<td>基准召回集有、候选召回集无</td>\n<td>倒排/向量召回逻辑变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过滤阶段</td>\n<td>两边召回集都有，候选过滤后无</td>\n<td>过滤条件或字段值变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>打分阶段</td>\n<td>过滤后都在，候选打分低于截断线</td>\n<td>打分函数变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>折叠阶段</td>\n<td>打分后都在，折叠时被同组其他文档挤掉</td>\n<td>折叠策略变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>截断阶段</td>\n<td>排名在 <code>max_rank</code> 之外</td>\n<td>位置变化而非消失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这五层判据要求回放器在候选链路上埋点。埋点成本不低（每层都要记录 doc id 集合），所以实践上常做 <strong>分层抽样埋点</strong>：只对触发了差异的查询补齐中间阶段记录，而不是全量埋点。这是一个典型的「两阶段回放」——先跑一遍只记录最终结果找出可疑查询，再对这批查询重跑并开启全链路埋点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"消失的严重度分级\">消失的严重度分级</h3><p>并非所有消失都一样严重。分级判据通常看三个方面：这个文档在基准里的排名有多高、这个查询的流量有多大、这个文档是不是该查询的「标准答案」。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>loss</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>rank</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>rank</mtext><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>traffic</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>judgment</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{loss}}(d, q) = w_{\\text{rank}} \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\log_2(\\text{rank}_b(d)+1)} \\cdot \\text{traffic}(q) \\cdot \\text{judgment}(d,q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">loss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rank</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2574em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">traffic</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">judgment</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>rank</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{\\text{rank}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rank</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是位置权重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>traffic</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{traffic}(q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">traffic</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是该查询的流量占比（采样权重的还原值），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>judgment</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{judgment}(d,q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">judgment</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是该文档对这个查询的人工相关度标注（如果没有标注则取中性值）。这个式子把「高排名文档从高流量查询里消失」推到最高优先级，而「低排名文档从长尾查询里消失」自然沉底。</p>\n<h2 id=\"大规模比对的技术实现\">大规模比对的技术实现</h2><p>逐条比对的复杂度看似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，但实际工程中的瓶颈在于数据搬运。一次回放可能产生上千万条结果、每条几十个文档，把两边结果集拉到一起比对需要仔细设计数据流。</p>\n<h3 id=\"集合运算的表达\">集合运算的表达</h3><p>如果结果集已经落在同一套可查询存储里，比对可以完全用 SQL 的集合运算表达，避免把数据搬到应用层：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 每条查询的 added / removed 明细（数组形式，保序）&#10;WITH base AS (&#10;  SELECT trace_id, sku_id, rank FROM replay_result&#10;  WHERE replay_run_id = :run AND version = &#39;baseline&#39;&#10;), cand AS (&#10;  SELECT trace_id, sku_id, rank FROM replay_result&#10;  WHERE replay_run_id = :run AND version = &#39;candidate&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;  COALESCE(b.trace_id, c.trace_id) AS trace_id,&#10;  array_agg(c.sku_id ORDER BY c.rank) FILTER (WHERE b.sku_id IS NULL) AS added,&#10;  array_agg(b.sku_id ORDER BY b.rank) FILTER (WHERE c.sku_id IS NULL) AS removed,&#10;  count(*) FILTER (WHERE b.sku_id IS NULL) AS added_n,&#10;  count(*) FILTER (WHERE c.sku_id IS NULL) AS removed_n&#10;FROM base b&#10;FULL OUTER JOIN cand c USING (trace_id, sku_id)&#10;GROUP BY 1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 每条查询的 added / removed 明细（数组形式，保序）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace_id, sku_id, rank </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replay_result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replay_run_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :run </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'baseline'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), cand </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace_id, sku_id, rank </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replay_result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replay_run_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :run </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'candidate'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">trace_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">trace_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  array_agg(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rank</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> added,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  array_agg(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rank</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> removed,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> added_n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> removed_n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FULL OUTER JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cand c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (trace_id, sku_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>FULL OUTER JOIN</code> 在这里是正确工具：它天然给出三态（仅左、仅右、都有）。用两次 <code>NOT IN</code> 表达会退化成两个独立的查询且无法处理重复文档。注意 <code>ORDER BY rank</code> 在 <code>array_agg</code> 里——保序的 added/removed 列表在报告里远比如集合更可读，因为分析者能一眼看出「消失的前五个都集中在中低价位」这类模式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"比对的规模门槛\">比对的规模门槛</h3><p>当结果集规模超过单机内存能一次 join 的量时，需要分区。按 <code>query_hash</code> 分区是最自然的选择（同一查询的两版结果落在同一分区），按 <code>trace_id</code> 哈希也可以但会打散同一查询的聚类。分区后每个 worker 独立做集合运算，输出差异明细再汇总。</p>\n<p>真正需要警惕的不是计算量而是<strong>输出的规模</strong>。如果一次回放产生了 200 万条差异明细，报告是没有价值的——分析者不可能读 200 万条。因此逐条比对的输出必须经过两级收敛：先用聚类把相似差异合并成模式（见下），再把明细作为下钻入口保留。</p>\n<h2 id=\"差异聚类-从逐条到模式\">差异聚类：从逐条到模式</h2><p>单条差异是证据，模式才是结论。聚类的作用是把「三万个查询各消失了一个文档」这种同一性质的问题折叠成一条结论。</p>\n<p>聚类维度通常取查询侧特征和文档侧特征的组合：查询的长度区间、查询是否有明确品牌词、消失文档所处的价格带、消失文档的上架时间、消失文档的历史点击率。把每条差异映射到这个特征空间，再按特征组合分组统计。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsonc\" data-code=\"// 聚类输出的一个模式簇&#10;{&#10;  &quot;pattern_id&quot;: &quot;removed_niche_brand_low_traffic&quot;,&#10;  &quot;feature_filter&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;query_has_brand&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;query_traffic_bucket&quot;: &quot;long_tail&quot;,&#10;    &quot;doc_price_band&quot;: &quot;high&quot;,&#10;    &quot;doc_age_days&quot;: &quot;&gt;180&quot;,&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;affected_queries&quot;: 3127,&#10;  &quot;affected_docs_avg&quot;: 1.4,&#10;  &quot;sample_trace_ids&quot;: [&quot;4bf92f35…&quot;, &quot;a1c9e0d2…&quot;],&#10;  &quot;hypothesis&quot;: &quot;品牌词查询下老商品被新打分函数降权&quot;,&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 聚类输出的一个模式簇</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"pattern_id\": \"removed_niche_brand_low_traffic\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"feature_filter\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"query_has_brand\": true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"query_traffic_bucket\": \"long_tail\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"doc_price_band\": \"high\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"doc_age_days\": \">180\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"affected_queries\": 3127,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"affected_docs_avg\": 1.4,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"sample_trace_ids\": [\"4bf92f35…\", \"a1c9e0d2…\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"hypothesis\": \"品牌词查询下老商品被新打分函数降权\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>sample_trace_ids</code> 是让报告可下钻的关键——分析者从模式跳到具体案例，验证假设是否成立。这条从「模式」到「单条」的通路，是把差异比对从统计报表变成可归因证据的分界线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>逐条比对要先定义稳定的比对键（业务主键而非引擎 <code>_id</code>）和比对范围（用户可见的前 N 位），否则会产生海量无意义差异。</li>\n<li>差异分为 SAME / RESCORED / SHIFTED / ADDED / REMOVED 五类，rank 未变的 score 变化不应计入 diff。</li>\n<li>消失的归因需要候选链路埋点，按召回/过滤/打分/折叠/截断五层定位，用两阶段回放控制埋点成本。</li>\n<li>消失严重度由基准排名、查询流量、人工标注共同决定；它的排序结果直接喂给发布门禁。</li>\n<li>输出必须聚类成模式，单条差异保留为下钻入口，否则报告不可读。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>排序位移是逐条比对之外的另一类核心差异，它的度量方式是下一篇 <a href=\"ranking-displacement-metric\">排序位移与变化度量</a> 的主题。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"结果新增/消失逐条比对","id":"结果新增-消失逐条比对"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把「差异」拆成可比对的成分","id":"核心概念-把-差异-拆成可比对的成分"},{"level":3,"text":"doc_id 的稳定性问题","id":"doc_id-的稳定性问题"},{"level":2,"text":"新增与消失的归因链","id":"新增与消失的归因链"},{"level":3,"text":"从候选链路定位消失原因","id":"从候选链路定位消失原因"},{"level":3,"text":"消失的严重度分级","id":"消失的严重度分级"},{"level":2,"text":"大规模比对的技术实现","id":"大规模比对的技术实现"},{"level":3,"text":"集合运算的表达","id":"集合运算的表达"},{"level":3,"text":"比对的规模门槛","id":"比对的规模门槛"},{"level":2,"text":"差异聚类：从逐条到模式","id":"差异聚类-从逐条到模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"回放确定性与时间/个性化处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-query-replay-diff/traffic-capture-replay/replay-determinism-time"},"next":{"title":"排序位移与变化度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-query-replay-diff/result-set-diff/ranking-displacement-metric"}}